## Scope of this license / 授权范围

The MIT license above covers **the source code written for this project**:
the FinPredict application (`FinPredict/src/`), the FIN_Terminal application
source (`project/src/`, `project/scripts/`, `project/config/`), and the
documentation in this repository.

The MIT license **does NOT** cover:

| Item | Reason / 说明 |
|------|----------------|
| `project/reverse/` | Third-party reverse-engineering evidence (TradingView). Not redistributed in the repository; local research only. 第三方逆向证据，不随仓库分发 |
| `project/data/` | Market data redistributed by Tencent / yfinance / Yahoo. Copyright belongs to the original providers; please comply with their terms. 数据版权归原提供方 |
| `FinPredict/dist_*/`, `project/dist/` | Build outputs; final binaries are published as GitHub Release assets. 构建产物 |

Market data, official announcements and research reports referenced by the
applications remain the property of their respective publishers (Tencent
Quotes, Yahoo Finance, SEC EDGAR, central banks, exchanges). This project is
for research and education only and does not provide investment advice.
